SUMMARY:Cuban Heritage Hop Dinner (Assembly Room and Kitchen)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our next Heritage Hop dinner\, featuring a meal inspired by Cuba and hosted by members of our congregation of Cuban descent. Enjoy a delicious meal while learning more about Cuban culture and traditions. $25 per person. Space is limited!\n\nRSVP HERE
