SUMMARY:Inquirer's Meeting (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:Inquirer’s Meeting: Sunday\, September 27\, After Worship \nConsidering membership at Union or curious to learn more? Join us Sunday\, September 27\, after worship for an information session about our church\, denomination\, governance\, opportunities to get involved\, and expectations of membership. There will also be time for questions and conversation. Can’t make it? Contact Rev. Katrina to find another time to connect.
