SUMMARY:Bible for Normal People Presentation: Understanding Eve (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:On September 30 at 8 PM\, Gerald Walle will host a viewing of a webinar on “Understanding Eve: Looking at the harm and why it didn’t have to be that way” in the Guild Room.  Ciarra Jones will speak about how Eve shaped the way women have been seen and understood in the Bible and how she and women can be seen in a very different and positive way. \n  \nContact Gerald for info and questions and to sign up
