SUMMARY:Family Fun Day (Camp Johnsonburg)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun afternoon for all ages at Camp Johnsonburg! Enjoy zip-lining\, boating\, apple roasting\, pumpkin bowling\, hiking\, and more\, followed by a hot meal together. The cost is $15-25 per person (pay what you can); children ages 0-4 are free. We’ll carpool together from Union. Please register directly through the Camp Johnsonburg website (click here) and let Rev. Leah know you’re attending by registering through Tithely (click here).
